Some ~~deleted text~~ and *emphasis with **nested bold** inside*. Escaped
\*literal asterisks\* and an HTML entity &copy; 2024 &mdash; plus <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>C</kbd>.

Autolinks: <https://example.com/docs> and <mailto:someone@example.com> or
<someone@example.com>. Reference links: [the guide][guide], [Guide][], and
an image by reference: ![logo][logo-ref].

[guide]: https://example.com/guide "The Guide"
[logo-ref]: ./images/logo.png

