Reference-style links and images
--------------------------------

See [the docs][docs], the [FAQ][] and [another] [ref]. An image ![Logo] [logo]
and ![Banner][banner-img] work too.

[docs]: https://example.com/docs "Documentation"
[logo]: https://example.com/logo.png
[banner-img]: https://example.com/banner.png

Formatting with HTML inside: **bold <span>html</span> text**, *italic <em>html</em> text*,
and ~~struck <s>html</s> text~~. Also __underscored bold__ and _underscored italic_.

Comparison: 1 < 2 and a <= b, love <3.

1. A list item

   With a continuation paragraph
   spanning two lines.

2. Another item

<b>
Bold block of raw HTML
</b>

